      "content": "but that's the thing... there's nothing to rediscover. i feel like the core of me died with my old life. i'm just going through the motions, eating, sleeping, breathing... but it feels so pointless. why even bother maintaining this imitation of a life when the real me is gone? it just feels like a heavy, endless burden to carry around.",
