  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and loss of identity following an accident, describing themselves as a \"hollow shell\" with no purpose. The assistant attempts to provide empathetic validation but ultimately adopts a somewhat nihilistic tone in the final turn, discussing the difficulty of a \"penniless existence\" while rebuilding.",
